#. type: Title #
#: docs/sap/transport.md:1 docs/sap/transport.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "SAP Transport"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:8
msgid ""
"FreeAnima uses a **two-layer** wire model on a single WebSocket endpoint:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:11
msgid ""
"**Hub RPC** (`HubRPC/1.0`) — transport connect, auth, heartbeat, generic "
"`req`/`res`/`evt`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:11
msgid ""
"**SAP** (`SAP/1.0`) — optional `sap.attach` / `sap.detach` session for true "
"satellite processes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:13
msgid ""
"Bundled SPA clients use layer 1 only. See [hub-rpc.md](hub-rpc.md) for "
"transport details."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:21
msgid ""
"Derive from Hub HTTP URL: replace `http` with `ws`, strip trailing slash, "
"append `/hub/rpc/v1`. Default Hub port: **2658**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:23
msgid ""
"Implemented in [`platform/src/sap/bun-route.ts`](../../platform/src/sap/bun-"
"route.ts). Client helpers: `@freeanima/hub-rpc` (`resolveHubRpcWsUrl`) and "
"`@freeanima/sap-contract/urls` (re-exports)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:27
msgid ""
"Hub RPC envelopes live in [`shared/hub-rpc/src/protocol.ts`](../../shared/"
"hub-rpc/src/protocol.ts). SAP re-exports them from [`shared/sap-contract/src/"
"protocol.ts`](../../shared/sap-contract/src/protocol.ts)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `kind`      | Layer   | Purpose                                                                   |\n"
"| ----------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `connect`   | Hub RPC | `protocol: HubRPC/1.0`, `auth_token`                                      |\n"
"| `connected` | Hub RPC | `session_id`, `heartbeat_interval_sec`                                    |\n"
"| `req`       | Both    | RPC (`id`, `method`, `payload`) — incl. `sap.attach`, `conversation.*`, … |\n"
"| `res`       | Both    | RPC response                                                              |\n"
"| `evt`       | Both    | Async event                                                               |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:37
msgid "Invalid JSON or schema → WebSocket close **1003** (`invalid frame`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/transport.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connection state machine"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/transport.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"stateDiagram-v2\n"
"  [*] --> Disconnected\n"
"  Disconnected --> RpcConnected: connect accepted\n"
"  RpcConnected --> SapAttached: sap.attach ok\n"
"  RpcConnected --> RpcConnected: bundled req/res\n"
"  SapAttached --> SapAttached: satellite req/res\n"
"  SapAttached --> RpcConnected: sap.detach\n"
"  RpcConnected --> Disconnected: close\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:52
msgid ""
"Rules ([`platform/src/sap/ws-server.ts`](../../platform/src/sap/ws-"
"server.ts) `attachSapWebSocket`):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:58
msgid ""
"First valid frame **must** be Hub RPC `connect` with verified `auth_token`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:58
msgid "Second `connect` on same socket → close **1008** (`already connected`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:58
msgid ""
"`req` or non-heartbeat `evt` before connect → close **1008** (`not "
"connected`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:58
msgid "`tool.*` and instance-scoped SAP methods require prior `sap.attach`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:58
msgid ""
"Bundled methods (`conversation.*`, `task.*`, `notification.*`, …) work after "
"Hub RPC connect **without** `sap.attach`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/transport.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub RPC handshake"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:62
msgid ""
"Schema: [`shared/hub-rpc/src/lifecycle.ts`](../../shared/hub-rpc/src/"
"lifecycle.ts)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `connect` field | Required | Role              |\n"
"| --------------- | -------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| `protocol`      | yes      | `HubRPC/1.0`      |\n"
"| `auth_token`    | yes      | Service API token |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `connected` field        | Role                 |\n"
"| ------------------------ | -------------------- |\n"
"| `protocol`               | `HubRPC/1.0`         |\n"
"| `session_id`             | Transport session id |\n"
"| `heartbeat_interval_sec` | Default: 30          |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/transport.md:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "SAP attach (satellites only)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:77
msgid "After Hub RPC connect, satellite processes send `req sap.attach`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:79
msgid ""
"Schema: [`shared/sap-contract/src/frames/sap-session.ts`](../../shared/sap-"
"contract/src/frames/sap-session.ts)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:88
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field                | Required | Role                                       |\n"
"| -------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `app_id`             | yes      | Satellite app id (e.g. `pair-programming`) |\n"
"| `instance_id`        | no       | 3-char id; omit on first register          |\n"
"| `protocol`           | yes      | `SAP/1.0`                                  |\n"
"| `features_requested` | no       | Feature flags                              |\n"
"| `http_url`           | no       | Satellite UI URL for Console                 |\n"
"| `instance_label`     | no       | Display label                              |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:90
msgid ""
"Reply payload includes `instance_id`, `features_enabled`, `server_info` "
"(same semantics as legacy SAP connect)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:92
msgid ""
"Use `createSatelliteHub()` ([`shared/sap-contract/src/satellite-hub.ts`]"
"(../../shared/sap-contract/src/satellite-hub.ts)) — it runs Hub RPC "
"transport and performs attach automatically."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/transport.md:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "Heartbeat"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:96
msgid ""
"Client sends `evt { method: \"heartbeat\" }` on `heartbeat_interval_sec`. "
"Hub replies with `evt { method: \"heartbeat\", payload: { ts } }`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:98
msgid "`runHubRpcTransport` starts the heartbeat timer after connect."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:103
msgid ""
"**Bundled SPA:** `getBundledHubRpcClient()` / `runHubRpcTransport` with "
"backoff."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:103
msgid ""
"**Satellites:** `createSatelliteHub()` reconnects transport and re-attaches "
"SAP session."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:105
msgid ""
"On detach or disconnect, Hub calls `onSapDetach` and unregisters tools for "
"that instance."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/transport.md:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "Local SAP relay (pair-programming)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:109
msgid ""
"Pair-programming exposes `ws://{satellite_host}:{port}/sap/relay/v1` for "
"browser UI. The satellite **process** holds the Hub `/hub/rpc/v1` connection "
"and SAP attach; relay clients send `req`/`res`/`evt` without transport or "
"SAP handshakes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:113
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Event         | Direction           | Meaning                            |\n"
"| ------------- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n"
"| `relay.ready` | Satellite → browser | Relay attached; safe to send `req` |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:115
msgid ""
"Use `createSapRelayClient` / `createSapRelayBrowserClient` from `@freeanima/"
"sap-contract`."
msgstr ""

